[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0834","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0834.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1180","title":"Oracle 8.1.5 Connection Manager Control cmctl 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Oracle 8.1.5 Connection Manager Control 组件中的 cmctl 程序存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。cmctl 在将用户提供的命令行参数复制到固定长度栈缓冲区前未进行长度检查，超长参数可覆盖栈上的返回地址。本地攻击者通过提交特制的超长命令行参数可触发缓冲区溢出，执行任意 shellcode，从而将权限提升至 oracle 用户（euid=oracle, egid=dba）。该漏洞影响 Oracle 8.1.5 for Linux 平台，攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1180"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"移除 cmctl 程序的 setuid/setgid 权限位：以 root 身份执行 chmod -s $ORACLE_HOME/bin/cmctl，阻止普通用户通过此漏洞提升权限。如业务允许，限制可执行 cmctl 的用户组或直接删除该程序的 setuid 位。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97474521003453&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1968","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5551","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20411"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20411"],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20411"],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0834.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0816","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0816.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1125","title":"Red Hat Linux restore 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.2 中 bundled 的 restore 工具（0.4b15 及更早版本）存在环境变量信任漏洞。该程序信任 RSH 环境变量指定的路径名，本地攻击者可预先修改 RSH 变量指向特洛伊木马程序，当 root 用户或特权进程调用 restore 时，木马将以 root 权限执行，导致本地权限提升。攻击者需具备本地账户访问权限以设置恶意环境变量。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1125"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 dump/restore 软件包至 0.4b16 及以上版本。临时缓解措施：以 root 运行 restore 前执行 unset RSH 清除环境变量，或移除 restore 和 dump 的 SUID 权限以防止普通用户利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97336034309944&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1914","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/184"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0816.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0802","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0802.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1112","title":"Microsoft Windows Media Player 7.0 任意脚本执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Media Player 7.0 在处理自定义皮肤文件(.wms)时存在任意脚本执行漏洞。由于播放器未对皮肤文件中嵌入的脚本代码进行安全验证，远程攻击者可构造包含恶意脚本的特制 .wms 文件并托管在恶意网站上，诱使用户访问后触发该漏洞。成功利用后攻击者可在用户上下文中执行任意脚本，获取用户权限。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS00-090 中发布补丁修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1112"],"sources":["exploitdb","cve"],"published":"2001-01-09","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-090 提供的 Windows Media Player 7 安全更新补丁（下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=BAF62356-D717-4B8F-97E0-299A7697A083），或升级到 Windows Media Player 7.1 及以上版本。如无法升级，可在 IE 中禁用 Windows Media Player 的 ActiveX 控件，并配置组策略禁止运行 .wms 皮肤文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1976","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-090","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5575","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20424"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0802.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0802.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0782","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0782.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1083","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0/2000 xp_showcolv 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0/2000 及 Microsoft Data Engine (MSDE) 1.0/2000 中的扩展存储过程 xp_showcolv 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过向受影响数据库系统发送特制参数，触发 srv_paraminfo API 调用中的缓冲区边界检查缺陷，导致缓冲区溢出，进而造成服务拒绝或执行任意命令。该漏洞允许拥有数据库登录权限的攻击者远程利用，危害严重。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1083"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"该漏洞对应 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-092。SQL Server 7.0 需先安装 Service Pack 2 后再安装 MS00-092 补丁（已包含于 SP3）；SQL Server 2000 直接安装 MS00-092 补丁（已包含于 SP1）。MSDE 1.0/2000 需安装对应补丁。作为缓解措施，可撤销 xp_showcolv 等受影响扩展存储过程的 EXECUTE 权限。由于以上产品均已终止支持，建议升级至受支持的 SQL Server 版本（如 SQL Server 2019/2022）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97570878710037&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2038","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-092","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20456","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-1083.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad6ba3d27513a57837704589c10c0be969a18efd/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1083.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1083","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1083.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1083.md","https://github.com/dependency-check/DependencyCheck/blob/7dcfc0737c21744b423c2198ae979003c2eb67e2/core/src/main/resources/dependencycheck-base-suppression.xml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d34115c5df8a79b3a76d7097ef910b9992c9ee85/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-86gg-6jj3-7gxr/GHSA-86gg-6jj3-7gxr.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/1xxx/cve-2000-1083.yaml","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1083.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0782.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0851","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0851.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1244","title":"Computer Associates InoculateIT Exchange Server 代理病毒防护绕过漏洞","description":"CA InoculateIT Agent for Exchange Server 在处理缺少 SMTP \"From\" 头字段的邮件时，未能正确识别附件中的病毒特征，导致病毒扫描机制被绕过。远程攻击者只需构造不含 From 头的畸形 SMTP 邮件并附带病毒附件发送至目标 Exchange 服务器，即可绕过病毒检测，使恶意代码抵达用户邮箱。该漏洞影响 Computer Associates InoculateIT 4.53 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1244"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:27.297","remediation":"升级到 Broadcom 官方提供的最新受支持版本（如原 CA InoculateIT 已停止维护，建议迁移至 Broadcom 当前支持的端点安全产品）。在邮件网关层面配置 SMTP 头校验规则，拒绝并拦截缺失 From 字段的邮件。同时启用 Exchange Server 传输规则，对缺少发件人头的邮件进行隔离处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0158.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20401","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1244.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1244","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1244.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1244.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q524-j64j-vqhj/GHSA-q524-j64j-vqhj.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88392/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1244.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153100_153200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5e4569ca-977c-43fb-b177-b32679d88590.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0851.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0850","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0850.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1234","title":"Phorum 3.0.7 violation.php3 任意邮件中继漏洞","description":"Phorum 3.0.7 的 violation.php3 文件存在任意邮件中继漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的 Mod 和 ForumName 参数，利用该脚本将邮件服务器作为垃圾邮件代理，向任意邮箱地址发送大量垃圾邮件。该漏洞影响 Phorum 3.0.7 版本，危害等级中等，攻击者无需特殊权限即可发起攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1234"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:26.140","remediation":"升级 Phorum 至 3.0.8 及以上版本，该版本已修复 violation.php3 的参数校验缺陷。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器配置中限制对 violation.php3 文件的访问，并验证 Mod 与 ForumName 参数来源。同时在防火墙中限制服务器仅允许授权的邮件中继目标地址。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cert.uni-stuttgart.de/archive/bugtraq/2000/01/msg00215.html","http://hispahack.ccc.de/mi020.html","http://www.digitalsec.net/stuff/z-mirrors/hispahack/mi020.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2272","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20587","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-1234.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1234.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1234","https://github.com/wietze/HijackLibs/blob/9f046bb5565cf5c1ae5414fdf26b9bc185fc548b/template.yml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1234.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1234.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-86wp-r8x2-p694/GHSA-86wp-r8x2-p694.json","https://github.com/greenbone/gsa/blob/a97298cb02e5ae1a5ef593cd95eee5887da7dbd1/src/web/pages/reports/__fixtures__/MockAuditDeltaReport.jsx","https://github.com/OWASP/www-project-top-10-infrastructure-security-risks/blob/0b5d245363af106ee5600b55b54227b04ecb2d7d/tab_opencallfordata.md","https://github.com/SofiaEngvall/ObsidianPublic/blob/bfac73143566169ca5a6aeca52bf16c831f65482/Tools%20n%20Info/13%20-%20Exploits%20&%20Vulns/-%20start%20here%20(exploits).md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0850.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0849","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0849.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1230","title":"Phorum 3.0.7 auth.php3 后门访问漏洞","description":"Phorum 3.0.7 的 auth.php3 认证脚本中存在后门访问漏洞。远程攻击者只需在 HTTP 请求中将 `PHP_AUTH_USER` 参数设置为特殊字符串 \"boogieman\"，即可绕过身份验证机制，直接访问受限的 Web 页面。该漏洞利用门槛极低，无需任何权限即可实施，可能导致敏感信息泄露或未授权操作。厂商至今未发布官方补丁，建议迁移至更高版本或采取 WAF 规则等缓解措施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1230"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:25.707","remediation":"立即升级 Phorum 至 3.0.8 及以上版本，该版本已移除 auth.php3 中的后门代码。如无法升级，手动编辑 auth.php3 文件，删除所有对 PHP_AUTH_USER 参数值为 \"boogieman\" 的特殊权限绕过逻辑，并在 Web 服务器层（如 .htaccess）对该文件增加 IP 访问控制或设置认证保护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cert.uni-stuttgart.de/archive/bugtraq/2000/01/msg00215.html","http://hispahack.ccc.de/mi020.html","http://www.digitalsec.net/stuff/z-mirrors/hispahack/mi020.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2274","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20588","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1230.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1230.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1230","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1230.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1230.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/203f3122909fa4769b6756ffd32fa646971a0b4e/2000/CVE-2000-1230.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f2ea71c23456d0bc766953e4ba2672b9cace7c4f/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1230.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1230.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1230.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1230.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0849.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0848","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0848.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1228","title":"Phorum 3.0.7 管理员密码未授权修改漏洞","description":"Phorum 3.0.7 版本的管理后台 admin.php3 存在未授权密码修改漏洞。由于该页面未对请求来源进行身份验证，远程攻击者无需登录即可通过构造包含 step、option、confirm 及 newPssword 参数的 HTTP 请求，直接修改管理员密码。攻击者可利用此漏洞完全接管论坛管理权限，进而控制整个论坛系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1228"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:25.480","remediation":"立即升级至 Phorum 3.0.8 及以上版本（推荐迁移至 Phorum 5.x 系列），该版本在 admin.php3 中增加了 session 认证检查，确保修改密码操作必须携带有效管理员会话凭证。如无法升级，手动在 admin.php3 文件顶部添加管理员身份验证逻辑：检查 $_SESSION['admin'] 或 $_COOKIE 中的有效登录令牌，未通过验证则拒绝执行密码修改操作（header('Location: login.php') 并 exit）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cert.uni-stuttgart.de/archive/bugtraq/2000/01/msg00215.html","http://hispahack.ccc.de/mi020.html","http://www.digitalsec.net/stuff/z-mirrors/hispahack/mi020.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2271","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20586","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1228.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1228","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1228.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1228.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c5vm-cg9p-c7r9/GHSA-c5vm-cg9p-c7r9.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1228.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ccab3e74-c835-414f-860b-3d0a971f1b34.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0848.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1687","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1687.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0885","title":"微软 系统管理服务器 Windows 2000 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags as required by the skill specification.<value>Microsoft Network Monitor (Netmon) 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞源于网络监控协议解析过程中的输入长度验证不足。攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的数据包（如包含超长浏览器名称的CIFS浏览帧、超长SNMP社区名、超长用户名或文件名等）触发溢出，导致应用程序崩溃并执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000、Systems Management Server 和 Windows NT 等版本，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5 级。攻击者最终可完全接管目标系统，获取控制权并执行恶意操作。Microsoft 已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞，用户需及时更新以确保安全。Microsoft 已经在 2000 年 12 月的安全更新中修复此漏洞。预计到 2000-12-19","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0885"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:40.397","remediation":"立即安装微软安全公告 MS00-078 发布的补丁程序（Windows 2000 需安装 SP2 或更高版本，Windows NT 4.0 需安装 SP6a 及后续补丁包 Q277467），或升级至 Windows 2000 SP4 / Windows NT 4.0 SP6a 及后续补丁包。若无法立即打补丁，建议在防火墙层面封锁 TCP 139/445 端口（SMB）及 UDP 161/162 端口（SNMP），并禁用不必要的 NetMon 网络监控服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-083","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5399","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2000/CVE-2000-0885.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0885.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0885","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0885.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0885.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h5rj-28xj-8wwg/GHSA-h5rj-28xj-8wwg.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88330/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a5d0ab84-e447-4793-afe3-1f072ba012d4.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1687.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1681","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1681.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0818","title":"Oracle Oracle Listener 命令执行漏洞","description":"Oracle 数据库监听程序默认安装版本 7.3.4、8.0.6 和 8.1.6 存在默认配置漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送 SET TRC_FILE 或 SET LOG_FILE 命令，将日志信息追加写入任意文件并实现任意命令执行。该漏洞源于监听程序默认配置允许未认证用户修改日志文件路径，攻击者可利用该特性覆盖系统关键文件（如 crontab、.rhosts）或写入恶意脚本实现远程代码执行。影响范围覆盖 Oracle 7.3.4、8.0.6、8.1.6 默认安装环境，CVSS 10.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），攻击无需认证、网络远程可利用、完全破坏机密性/完整性/可用性。攻击者只需向监听端口（默认 1521）发送特制 TNS 命令即可触发，无需任何认证凭证。Oracle 已发布补丁修复该默认配置缺陷，建议升级至修复版本或限制监听器网络访问权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0818"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:32.423","remediation":"立即升级Oracle Listener到安全版本：申请并安装Oracle发布的完整安全补丁包（已修复验证逻辑及文件写入漏洞）。同时，将`listener.ora`文件权限限制为root所有rw-，并将TRC_FILE及LOG_FILE文件路径限制在/log/oracle/listener目录内，不可写入系统根目录，避免任意文件写入。永久删除未使用的SET命令权限，仅保留管理员操作，并开启监听日志审计功能，记录所有listener操作，第一时间发现异常写入行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://otn.oracle.com/deploy/security/pdf/listener_alert.pdf","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise66.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5380","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0818.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0818","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0818.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0818.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-44qf-4fcj-9qhq/GHSA-44qf-4fcj-9qhq.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/e7a1e0098ca50c8dc77455488033ca407ec81282/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2013/gb_oracle_database_listener_sec_bypass_vuln.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0818.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1681.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1680","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1680.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0817","title":"微软 网络监视器 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Network Monitor (Netmon) 的 HTTP 协议解析器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未经身份验证的攻击者可通过发送畸形 HTTP 数据包触发缓冲区溢出，进而在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Network Monitor 相关版本，攻击向量为网络远程利用，无需身份验证，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.5（HIGH），可导致系统机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损。Microsoft 已发布安全补丁修复该漏洞，建议用户尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0817"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:32.303","remediation":"立即停用 Microsoft Network Monitor（Netmon），因为该工具已停止维护且存在安全漏洞。如果必须继续使用，请通过 Microsoft 官方安全更新确保已安装所有 2001 年后发布的 Netmon 更新补丁，并且仅在局域网内通过 IPsec 加密访问，避免互联网直接暴露。另外，建议将网络监控功能迁移到当前支持的 Wireshark 或 Microsoft Message Analyzer等现代工具，并彻底删除不再需要的 Netmon组件以彻底消除漏洞风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/index.php","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-083","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5399","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0817.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0817","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0817.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0817.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x726-32vx-56pp/GHSA-x726-32vx-56pp.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88338/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/CERTCC/SBOM/blob/ae581e32992458f65018df4eced684b7370bba39/SwiftBOM/cpe_lookup/cve_lookup/microsoft/network_monitor_cve.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0817.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8b2b9a8673bea39f5c895cdb2f43d026330c1de0/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1680.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1609","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0803","title":"GNU Groff 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"GNU Groff 在处理设备描述文件时存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可在当前工作目录中构造包含恶意 postpro 指令的描述文件，当其他用户运行 groff 时，该指令会被执行，从而导致攻击者获取额外系统权限。该漏洞影响所有使用 Groff 的 Unix/Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议升级至包含补丁的版本或限制 groff 对当前目录描述文件的搜索行为。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0803"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:30.807","remediation":"升级 GNU Groff 至 1.17 及以上版本，该版本已修复 groff 从当前工作目录搜索设备描述文件的安全问题。如无法升级，可移除当前目录下设备描述文件的写权限，或使用 AppArmor/SELinux 策略限制 groff 读取非标准路径下的描述文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5280","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0803.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/groff/CVE-2000-0803.nopatch","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0803","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0803.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0803.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wph5-jqqm-rqpf/GHSA-wph5-jqqm-rqpf.json","https://github.com/EchoHeim/RK3399-linux/blob/a102679d1884be98e17cc26ee6349702d796426a/yocto/poky/meta/conf/distro/include/cve-extra-exclusions.inc","https://github.com/Indie365/cbl-mariner/blob/80d864c0a617439675510c037c8a4589aa596fbb/SPECS/groff/groff.spec","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0803.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1609.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1014","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0923","title":"Aplio PRO authenticate.cgi 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Aplio PRO 设备的 authenticate.cgi CGI 程序存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 password 参数中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Aplio PRO 系列设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者只需向目标设备的 authenticate.cgi 接口发送特制 HTTP 请求即可触发，可能导致设备被完全控制、敏感信息泄露或作为跳板攻击内网其他系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0923"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:46.530","remediation":"立即停止使用 Aplio PRO 设备，该产品已停止维护且无安全补丁可用。如无法下线，在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）配置中禁止外部访问 authenticate.cgi 脚本，添加 `<Files \"authenticate.cgi\"> Order Deny,Allow Deny from all </Files>` 规则；同时在防火墙层面将 Aplio PRO 管理端口（默认 80/443）的访问源限制为可信管理 IP 段，禁止互联网直接访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0107.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1784","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5333","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0923.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0923","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0923.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0298403c910e42219c357a4f56dac428565b2e47/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0923.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q584-qw8x-gq9g/GHSA-q584-qw8x-gq9g.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0923.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/dangerous_cgis.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0923.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/dangerous_cgis.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1014.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1014.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1014.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1013","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0918","title":"KDE kvt 格式化字符串代码执行漏洞","description":"KDE 1.1.2 版本中的 kvt（KDE 虚拟终端）存在格式化字符串漏洞，本地攻击者可通过构造包含格式化字符的 DISPLAY 环境变量触发该漏洞，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 KDE 1.1.2 及可能受影响的早期版本，攻击者需要具备本地用户权限才能利用，CVSS 评分为 7.2，危害等级较高。攻击者可利用此漏洞完全控制受影响系统，造成严重的安全风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0918"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:45.863","remediation":"升级到 KDE 1.1.3 或更高版本以修复 kvt 程序中的格式字符串漏洞；作为临时缓解措施，可在登录环境中清除或过滤 DISPLAY 环境变量中的格式化字符（如 %n、%s、%x），或禁止本地用户设置 DISPLAY 变量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/83914","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1700","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c7415a52c8c7c49b12758f6cb68d7d41d1190b12/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0918.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0918","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/333d3943ba23bf18333ea9f9256241d1bb61356e/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0918.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/12664c75fe6d00113fe15964cee65a90965e367a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0918.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q4wg-3c94-73xq/GHSA-q4wg-3c94-73xq.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1700/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0918.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/c90667dd27dc06c0e714f08056d9840b16c63d0e/2000.tsv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0918.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1012","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0915","title":"freebsd 任意文件读取漏洞 漏洞","description":"tags.<value>FreeBSD 4.1.1 的 fingerd 服务存在任意文件读取漏洞，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过远程向 finger 服务发送特制的请求，将目标文件名作为用户参数传入，从而读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 4.1.1 及此前版本的 finger 服务，CVSS 评分为 5，属于中等危害等级。攻击条件仅为网络可达且目标开放 finger 服务（通常为 TCP 端口 79），攻击者可利用此漏洞获取系统敏感配置文件或用户信息等文件内容。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0915"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:45.440","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 系统至 4.1.1-STABLE（修正日期 2000-10-05 之后版本）。如无法立即升级，可从 ftp://ftp.freebsd.org/pub/FreeBSD/CERT/patches/SA-00:54/fingerd.patch 获取补丁并手动修补：cd /usr/src/usr.bin/finger 执行 patch 和 make all install，再 cd /usr/src/libexec/fingerd 执行 make all install。作为临时缓解措施，在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释掉 finger 服务行（#finger stream tcp nowait/3/10 nobody /usr/libexec/fingerd fingerd -s），并同时注释掉 IPv6 对应的 finger 行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","reference